# W31e, c (k10): joins a in stag0201, goes on to stag0202 (matz00) and into dng205b1 (stag0202's matz01) at about the time
# a goes into dng204b1. (Run b1: the mummies of stag0201 felled c on its way to matz00; it heals from the L panel at 350
# HP now, twice on the way to stag0202 and once in it.)
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@120
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log c in stag0201
idle until frames>=600
explore matz00 yes until stage=stag0202,control or hp<=350 fail epoch>=@600
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=900
explore matz00 yes until stage=stag0202,control or hp<=350 fail epoch>=@600
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=900
explore matz00 yes until stage=stag0202,control fail epoch>=@600
log c in stag0202
idle until epoch>=@640
explore matz01 yes until stage=dng205b1,control or hp<=350 fail epoch>=@900
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=900
explore matz01 yes until stage=dng205b1,control fail epoch>=@900
log c in dng205b1
idle until present=2,sealed>=600 fail epoch>=@1400
log b joined c
